        C --> D[English, French, Indonesian]
        
        E[💎 Dhikr Collection] --> F[Time-Based Remembrance]
        F --> G[Prayer Time Specific Dhikr]
        G --> H[General Daily Reminders]
        
        I[🕐 Prayer Times Data] --> J[Location-Based Calculations]
        J --> K[Aladhan API Integration]
        K --> L[5 Daily Prayer Times]
    end

    subgraph "🎯 Content-Aware Integration"
        M[Content Detection Result] --> N{Content Category}
        N -->|Face Content| O[👁️ Lower Gaze Guidance]
