        U -->|Isha Time| Z[🌙 Night Reflection]
        U -->|General Time| AA[🔄 Daily Reminders]
        
        V --> BB[Display Dhikr Overlay]
        W --> BB
        X --> BB
        Y --> BB
        Z --> BB
        AA --> BB
    end

    subgraph "🔔 Prayer Time Notifications"
        CC[Prayer Notification Worker] --> DD[Location Service]
        DD --> EE[Calculate Prayer Times]
